{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify Liquid and CSS developer. Write the complete, production-ready code for a custom Shopify blog header/author profile section that replicates the layout of image_fce530.png 100% with exact visual precision, spatial structure, and styling logic.
    
    ### Section Configuration & Schema Requirements:
    1. Wrap the entire layout in a fully customizable Shopify section.
    2. Include a settings schema so the merchant can customize:
       - Author Avatar Initials text (default: "CP") or an optional image picker to replace the initials.
       - Author Name text (default: "Chad Peshke").
       - Author Role Badge text (default: "Founder & CEO").
       - Biography/Description paragraph text (default: "Writing on retail execution, conversion intelligence, decision-making at store level, and why dashboards alone don't move the needle.").
       - Social Media Links: Text inputs for LinkedIn URL and Twitter/X URL (dynamically hiding icons if empty).
       - Tag Cloud Kicker text (default: "WHAT THIS BLOG IS ABOUT").
    3. Use a blocks schema (`blocks`) for the tag cloud pills on the right, allowing the merchant to dynamically add, edit, or link specific blog tags (e.g., "Retail execution", "Conversion", "Store ops").
    4. Include standard `{% schema %}` with presets so it can be added directly via the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    ### Visual & Style Specifications (1:1 Replication):
    1. **Global Layout & Structure:**
       - A wide, low-profile banner section with an ultra-light gray/off-white background color (`#f8fafc` or `#f9f9f9`).
       - Inner content wrapper centered with a max-width of 1200px and broad horizontal padding.
       - On desktop, the section splits into an expansive, asymmetric flex row: the Author Profile block occupies the left side (approx. 60-65% width) and the Tag Cloud block anchors precisely to the right side (approx. 35-40% width). On mobile, the blocks stack vertically and center cleanly.
    
    2. **Left Block (Author Profile Group):**
       - **Avatar Badge:** A distinct squircle / heavily rounded square container (`border-radius: 20px`), measuring roughly 80px x 80px on desktop. It features a deep dark navy blue background (`#0a255c`) with the initials "CP" perfectly centered in a bold, crisp white font.
       - **Text Info Column:** Sits adjacent to the avatar badge with a comfortable, proportional gap.
         - **Name Line:** A horizontal flex row featuring the Author Name in a heavy, bold dark navy blue (`#0a255c`), immediately followed by an inline, pill-shaped badge. The badge has a soft grayish-blue tint background (`#e2e8f0`), a small tracking-wide font, and reads "Founder & CEO".
         - **Biography Text:** Positioned directly below the name line with tight padding. It uses a neutral, highly readable slate-gray font color (`#475569`) with elegant, compact line-height.
         - **Social Links:** A horizontal row of tiny, perfectly circular outline buttons (`border: 1px solid #cbd5e1`) positioned beneath the biography text, housing clean social media brand glyphs (LinkedIn and Twitter/X) in a muted gray color.
    
    3. **Right Block (Tag Cloud Group):**
       - **Kicker Label:** Aligned to the top right of its block, reading "WHAT THIS BLOG IS ABOUT" in a tiny, wide-tracked, uppercase semi-bold font using a light slate-gray color (`#94a3b8`).
       - **Tag Pills Grid:** Positioned below the kicker label, featuring a right-aligned wrap layout (`flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end;`). 
       - **Pill Styling:** Each tag pill is a capsule shape (`border-radius: 9999px`) with a solid white background (`#ffffff`), a very fine light-gray border (`1px solid #e2e8f0`), deep horizontal padding, and a compact font. The text inside is a clean charcoal color (`#334155`). Ensure the pills wrap beautifully into a two-row staggered formation exactly as showcased in image_fce530.png.
    
    Output only the clean, copy-pasteable code containing the HTML structure, embedded CSS (or Tailwind utility classes), and the Shopify Liquid schema.
    
    
    The image of the ceo should be customisable
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-blog-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 0 {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-layout-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-author-block-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1 1 60%;
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-avatar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.avatar_background_color }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-avatar-initials-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.avatar_text_color }};
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-avatar-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-author-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-name-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-author-name-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.name_color }};
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-role-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.role_badge_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.role_badge_text_color }};
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-bio-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.bio_text_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-social-links-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.social_border_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.social_icon_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.social_hover_border_color }};
    background-color: {{ block.settings.social_hover_background }};
  }

  .ai-blog-header-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-tags-block-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1 1 35%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-tags-kicker-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.kicker_text_color }};
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-tags-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-tag-pill-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.tag_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.tag_border_color }};
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: {{ block.settings.tag_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    line-height: 1.4;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-blog-header-tag-pill-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.tag_hover_background }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.tag_hover_border_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-blog-header-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    .ai-blog-header-layout-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .ai-blog-header-author-block-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 1 1 100%;
    }

    .ai-blog-header-tags-block-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 1 1 100%;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .ai-blog-header-tags-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-blog-header-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .ai-blog-header-author-block-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .ai-blog-header-avatar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      border-radius: 18px;
    }

    .ai-blog-header-avatar-initials-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .ai-blog-header-author-name-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .ai-blog-header-bio-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-blog-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-blog-header-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-blog-header-layout-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-blog-header-author-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-blog-header-avatar-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.avatar_image != blank %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.avatar_image | image_url: width: 160 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.author_name | escape }}"
              class="ai-blog-header-avatar-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              width="80"
              height="80"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          {% else %}
            <span class="ai-blog-header-avatar-initials-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.avatar_initials }}
            </span>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="ai-blog-header-author-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-blog-header-name-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h1 class="ai-blog-header-author-name-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.author_name }}
            </h1>
            {% if block.settings.role_badge != blank %}
              <span class="ai-blog-header-role-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.role_badge }}
              </span>
            {% endif %}
          </div>

          {% if block.settings.bio_text != blank %}
            <p class="ai-blog-header-bio-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.bio_text }}
            </p>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="ai-blog-header-social-links-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.linkedin_url != blank %}
              <a
                href="{{ block.settings.linkedin_url }}"
                class="ai-blog-header-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                aria-label="LinkedIn"
              >
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"></path>
                  <rect x="2" y="9" width="4" height="12"></rect>
                  <circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"></circle>
                </svg>
              </a>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.twitter_url != blank %}
              <a
                href="{{ block.settings.twitter_url }}"
                class="ai-blog-header-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                aria-label="X (Twitter)"
              >
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M4 4l11.733 16h4.267l-11.733 -16z"></path>
                  <path d="M4 20l6.768 -6.768m2.46 -2.46l6.772 -6.772"></path>
                </svg>
              </a>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-blog-header-tags-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.tags_kicker != blank %}
          <div class="ai-blog-header-tags-kicker-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.tags_kicker }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        <div class="ai-blog-header-tags-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% for i in (1..8) %}
            {% liquid
              assign tag_label_key = 'tag_' | append: i | append: '_label'
              assign tag_url_key = 'tag_' | append: i | append: '_url'
              assign tag_label = block.settings[tag_label_key]
              assign tag_url = block.settings[tag_url_key]
            %}

            {% if tag_label != blank %}
              {% if tag_url != blank %}
                <a
                  href="{{ tag_url }}"
                  class="ai-blog-header-tag-pill-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                >
                  {{ tag_label }}
                </a>
              {% else %}
                <span class="ai-blog-header-tag-pill-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ tag_label }}
                </span>
              {% endif %}
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

